{"type":"standard","title":"2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q112610258","titles":{"canonical":"2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election","normalized":"2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election</span></span>"},"pageid":69739643,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":810,"height":810},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1373575117","tid":"cbcbc4d2-aa20-11f1-89c8-30abe759b110","timestamp":"2026-09-06T18:28:46Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2022_Rhode_Island_lieutenant_gubernatorial_election"}},"extract":"The 2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election was held on November 8, 2022, to elect the lieutenant governor of the state of Rhode Island. The election coincided with various other federal and state elections, including for Governor of Rhode Island. Primary elections were held on September 13. Rhode Island is one of 21 states that elects its lieutenant governor separately from its governor.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2022 Rhode Island lieutenant gubernatorial election</b> was held on November 8, 2022, to elect the lieutenant governor of the state of Rhode Island. The election coincided with various other federal and state elections, including for Governor of Rhode Island. Primary elections were held on September 13. Rhode Island is one of 21 states that elects its lieutenant governor separately from its governor.</p>"}